A||||10||Alex4mula||Getrag on 87 4 cyl??||||1||
Z||000000||Alex4mula||06-20-2001||04:06 PM||||If I am correct all stick 87 4 cyl came with the Isuzu 5 speed. If so, can I easily change the Isuzu for a Getrag (5 speed)? Or the linkages are different?<BR>TIA<P>------------------<BR>Alex4mula<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p69fbfe3e99ec5a0b81c10afcc578ff95/fe6d5c42.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||06-20-2001||04:31 PM||||You can certainly use a Getrag on a coupe (in place of the Isuzu), but you'll need the Getrag shifter & select cables as well as the rear tranny bracket (the big one).....maybe even the rear one, not sure.<P>You'll also need to use the throw out bearing from  the Getrag.<P>I think that's it, but there may be a few more minor things that need to be swapped out. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Alex4mula||06-20-2001||04:55 PM||||Mmmm...  Not impossible but more complicated than I wanted. Thanks a lot.<P>------------------<BR>Alex4mula<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/p69fbfe3e99ec5a0b81c10afcc578ff95/fe6d5c42.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||12
